 My Response }

Dearest 62b0F,

I marvel at the compelling tales of angels touching our lives and showering us with blessings. Not unlike your stories regarding finances and a rare job opportunity that came to light, I too have experienced serendipitous happenings. One particular incident occurred during my daughter's school battle with depression. Against all odds and numerous setbacks, her determination to attend college and chase her dreams remained steadfast.

